{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49112","headline":"虞美人 一 · 後主煜","name":"虞美人 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"风回小院庭芜绿，柳眼春相续。\n凭阑半日独无言，依旧竹声新月，似当年。\n笙歌未散尊罍在，池面冰初解。\n烛明香暗画楼深，满鬓清霜残雪，思难禁。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"後主煜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49112.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49112","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}